      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>Request source<table><tbody><tr><td>Enumeration item</td><td>Enumeration value</td><td>Description</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_UNSPECIFIED</td><td>0</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_RAG</td><td>1</td><td>Standard mode</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_WORKFLOW</td><td>2</td><td>Workflow</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_PLUGIN</td><td>3</td><td>Plug-in</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_OPENCLAW</td><td>4</td><td>openclaw</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_RECALL_TEST</td><td>5</td><td>Recall test</td></tr><tr><td>CALL_SOURCE_RECALL_TEST_DIFF</td><td>6</td><td>Recall test in comparison scenarios also needs to trigger the retrieval interface. The difference is that in this case, the frontend does not need to update the latest configuration. Because when comparing 1, 2, and 3, the final saved one may be 2.</td></tr></tbody></table></p>",
